  { q: 'How many milliliters is a US cup?', a: 'A US customary cup is 236.588 milliliters, which is 8 US fluid ounces. On US nutrition labels the cup is rounded to 240 milliliters by FDA regulation. The metric cup is 250 milliliters. The Best Answer Hub Cooking Converter uses the standard you pick so the conversion is correct for your recipe.' },
