        <h1>Cups to Grams, <em>and Whose Cup You Mean</em></h1>
        <p class="dek">A plain guide to cooking measurements: why a cup of flour and a cup of sugar weigh different amounts, how many grams are really in a cup, the difference between a US cup and a metric cup, the tablespoon that trips up Australian recipes, and how to read oven temperatures. The Best Answer Hub Cooking Converter does it ingredient by ingredient, in your browser.</p>
