          <span class="kicker">Convert it now</span>
          <h3>Open the Cooking Converter</h3>
          <p>Free, no signup, and calculated entirely in your browser. Pick the ingredient, choose your cup, and switch between cups, grams, milliliters, tablespoons, and ounces, or scale a whole recipe.</p>
          <a class="btn" href="/calculators/cooking-converter/">Convert a measurement</a>
